WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.788 --> 00:00:03.128
"Oh no!"

2
00:00:03.168 --> 00:00:03.869
Maggie exclaimed.

3
00:00:03.889 --> 00:00:04.710
"My shirt is ruined!"

4
00:00:04.730 --> 00:00:05.491
Ms. Wood came over.

5
00:00:05.511 --> 00:00:08.033
"Oh dear," she said when she saw Maggie's shirt.

6
00:00:08.053 --> 00:00:08.794
"What happened?"

7
00:00:08.814 --> 00:00:14.819
"Big Spot slobbered on me!"

8
00:00:15.239 --> 00:00:15.660
Maggie said.

9
00:00:29.972 --> 00:00:32.413
"Is pony slobber always blue?"

10
00:00:32.733 --> 00:00:33.433
Henry asked.

11
00:00:34.293 --> 00:00:36.194
He didn't know much about ponies and horses.

12
00:00:36.554 --> 00:00:38.554
But the blue stain seemed kind of strange.

13
00:00:39.795 --> 00:00:40.795
Maggie scowled at him.

14
00:00:40.815 --> 00:00:42.595
"Of course not!"

15
00:00:42.876 --> 00:00:43.336
she said.

16
00:00:43.356 --> 00:00:47.297
"Big Spot must have eaten something blue."

17
00:00:48.417 --> 00:00:50.698
"None of our usual horse treats are that color."

18
00:00:52.898 --> 00:00:55.379
Ms. Wood opened Big Spot's mouth to look inside.

19
00:00:56.259 --> 00:00:57.539
She sounded a little worried.

20
00:00:57.559 --> 00:00:59.380
"I wonder what he ate."

21
00:01:00.572 --> 00:01:03.173
"I can't wear this shirt in the show," Maggie wailed.

22
00:01:03.193 --> 00:01:05.914
"I look ridiculous!"

23
00:01:07.095 --> 00:01:08.155
"Now, Maggie," Ms.

24
00:01:08.215 --> 00:01:08.855
Wood said.

25
00:01:08.875 --> 00:01:11.296
"The judge won't be looking at what you're wearing.

26
00:01:12.177 --> 00:01:13.657
She'll be looking at how you're riding."

27
00:01:13.677 --> 00:01:17.039
"Maybe." Maggie didn't sound convinced.

28
00:01:17.059 --> 00:01:20.560
"But I'll still look like a slob in front of everyone!"

29
00:01:20.580 --> 00:01:23.982
"I have an idea, Maggie," Henry said.

30
00:01:24.002 --> 00:01:27.123
"Try turning your shirt inside out.

31
00:01:28.203 --> 00:01:29.764
Maybe the stain won't show that way."

32
00:01:30.772 --> 00:01:32.373
Maggie's face brightened instantly.

33
00:01:32.393 --> 00:01:34.893
"Henry, you're a genius!"

34
00:01:35.253 --> 00:01:35.734
she cried.

35
00:01:35.754 --> 00:01:37.754
"I'll be right back."

36
00:01:39.735 --> 00:01:41.155
She ducked behind the stall door.

37
00:01:41.175 --> 00:01:42.856
"Thanks, Henry."

38
00:01:43.096 --> 00:01:44.516
Ms. Wood smiled with relief.

39
00:01:44.536 --> 00:01:46.877
"I think you just saved the day."

40
00:01:48.057 --> 00:01:50.778
Seconds later Maggie emerged with her shirt turned inside out.

41
00:01:50.798 --> 00:01:53.279
"Much better," she said.

42
00:01:53.299 --> 00:01:56.260
"Try not to slime this side too, okay, Spot?"

43
00:01:59.444 --> 00:02:00.724
She put on the pony's bridle.

44
00:02:01.605 --> 00:02:04.445
Then she hurried out of the barn leading Big Spot behind her.

45
00:02:05.006 --> 00:02:05.986
Ms. Wood left too.

46
00:02:06.886 --> 00:02:08.627
Henry headed back to the lemonade stand.

47
00:02:10.507 --> 00:02:13.148
"Oh good," Uncle Bruce said when Henry arrived.

48
00:02:13.168 --> 00:02:15.869
"I just saw Maggie getting on her pony."

49
00:02:15.889 --> 00:02:19.850
"Yeah, her class will be starting soon," Henry said.

50
00:02:19.870 --> 00:02:22.750
"Have you seen Cole since I left?"

51
00:02:23.791 --> 00:02:25.611
"No." Uncle Bruce shook his head.

52
00:02:25.631 --> 00:02:27.952
"But I could have used his help.

53
00:02:28.172 --> 00:02:29.713
The lemonade stand was pretty busy."

54
00:02:29.733 --> 00:02:33.095
"The next class will begin in three minutes!"

55
00:02:33.515 --> 00:02:35.276
Ms. Wood said over the loudspeaker.

56
00:02:35.296 --> 00:02:39.659
"I want to find a good spot to watch the show," Uncle Bruce told Henry.

57
00:02:39.679 --> 00:02:41.119
"Want to come along?"

58
00:02:41.140 --> 00:02:45.022
"I have to stay with the lemonade stand," Henry said.

59
00:02:45.042 --> 00:02:48.204
"I can watch Maggie from here."

60
00:02:49.264 --> 00:02:50.845
Uncle Bruce nodded and hurried off.

61
00:02:52.746 --> 00:02:55.708
There were no customers at the moment, so Henry sat down to think.

62
00:02:56.700 --> 00:02:59.201
He needed to figure out whether Rebecca was the shirt thief.

63
00:03:00.222 --> 00:03:02.683
He wished Cole was there to help him come up with a plan.

64
00:03:02.703 --> 00:03:05.964
"Where is Cole, anyway?"

65
00:03:06.324 --> 00:03:06.944
Henry muttered.

66
00:03:08.005 --> 00:03:08.745
He looked around.

67
00:03:09.526 --> 00:03:12.267
He didn't see Cole, but he saw Kira walking by.

68
00:03:13.227 --> 00:03:16.368
She was still wearing her show coat, and her face was red and sweaty.

69
00:03:16.388 --> 00:03:18.769
"Hi," Henry said to her.

70
00:03:18.789 --> 00:03:20.410
"You look hot.

71
00:03:20.950 --> 00:03:22.911
Why don't you take off your coat for a while?"

72
00:03:24.032 --> 00:03:24.732
Kira paused.

73
00:03:25.428 --> 00:03:26.708
"It's okay," she said.

74
00:03:26.728 --> 00:03:28.149
"I'm not that hot."

75
00:03:29.029 --> 00:03:33.910
Henry wondered if she was afraid someone might steal her coat, just like someone had stolen Daisy's shirt.

76
00:03:33.930 --> 00:03:36.991
"Have you seen my friend Cole anywhere?"

77
00:03:37.251 --> 00:03:37.771
he asked.

78
00:03:38.732 --> 00:03:40.152
He described what Cole looked like.

79
00:03:40.172 --> 00:03:42.913
"I know who you mean," Kira said.

80
00:03:42.933 --> 00:03:44.573
"I saw him earlier.

81
00:03:45.814 --> 00:03:50.015
He was behind the barn helping Daisy wash some mud off her pony's legs with the hose.

82
00:03:51.035 --> 00:03:52.696
That was over an hour ago, though.

83
00:03:53.316 --> 00:03:53.996
Maybe longer.

84
00:03:54.600 --> 00:03:55.881
I haven't seen him since then."

85
00:03:56.902 --> 00:04:00.326
She glanced at the ring, where Maggie and the other riders were trotting in a circle.

86
00:04:00.346 --> 00:04:03.529
"Excuse me, I'd better go check on my pony."

87
00:04:05.110 --> 00:04:05.791
She hurried off.

88
00:04:05.811 --> 00:04:09.314
"Well, at least that's one mystery solved."

89
00:04:09.594 --> 00:04:10.715
Henry said with a sigh.

90
00:04:11.756 --> 00:04:15.760
Now he knew where Cole had been earlier when Cole was supposed to be looking for napkins.

91
00:04:16.721 --> 00:04:19.444
Too bad that wasn't the mystery Henry was trying to solve!

92
00:04:20.480 --> 00:04:23.202
"Riders, please ask your horses to walk," Ms.

93
00:04:23.262 --> 00:04:24.724
Wood said over the loudspeaker.

94
00:04:24.744 --> 00:04:27.125
"The judge is watching you now."

95
00:04:28.366 --> 00:04:31.989
As Henry turned to watch the show class, he saw Cole hurrying toward him.

96
00:04:32.009 --> 00:04:34.971
"Finally!" Henry exclaimed.

97
00:04:34.991 --> 00:04:36.733
"Where have you been?"

98
00:04:36.753 --> 00:04:40.515
"Sorry," Cole said breathlessly.

99
00:04:40.535 --> 00:04:43.398
"I started to look for clues in the barn.

100
00:04:43.998 --> 00:04:46.480
But then a little kid asked me to help her carry a saddle."

101
00:04:47.464 --> 00:04:50.546
"Well, it took you an awfully long time," Henry said.

102
00:04:50.566 --> 00:04:53.288
"Maggie's class is starting," Cole said.

103
00:04:53.308 --> 00:04:54.649
"We'd better watch."

104
00:04:55.830 --> 00:04:58.372
Henry noticed that Rebecca was riding in the class too.

105
00:04:59.392 --> 00:05:00.793
She wasn't riding Coco though.

106
00:05:01.574 --> 00:05:02.935
She was riding a different pony.

107
00:05:03.935 --> 00:05:06.197
"Look, there's Rebecca," Henry said.

108
00:05:06.217 --> 00:05:09.879
"We should watch her to see if she does anything suspicious."

109
00:05:11.000 --> 00:05:12.301
"Why?" Cole asked.

110
00:05:13.322 --> 00:05:16.304
Henry realized Cole didn't know that Rebecca was a suspect yet.

111
00:05:17.524 --> 00:05:20.066
Henry told him what had happened between Rebecca and Daisy.

112
00:05:20.086 --> 00:05:22.627
"That's weird," Cole said.

113
00:05:22.647 --> 00:05:25.049
"Look! I think the class is finished."

114
00:05:25.989 --> 00:05:28.070
The riders were lining up in front of the judge.

115
00:05:29.091 --> 00:05:30.352
A few moments later, Ms.

116
00:05:30.372 --> 00:05:31.733
Wood began announcing the winners.

117
00:05:34.094 --> 00:05:35.715
Soon she got to the final ribbon.

118
00:05:35.735 --> 00:05:43.500
"The first-place ribbon goes to Maggie riding Big Spot!"
